[2026-07-29] INCIDENT + FIX (acquisition stuck ~7 days).
  Symptom: daemon alive since 2026-07-22 but HITs frozen at 4372; acquire_stats.log showed 340x "sustained throttle -> cooldown 1800s".
  Root cause: classyfire.wishartlab.com CHANGED behaviour for InChIKeys it cannot classify: it now returns HTTP 500 (previously HTTP 404). ~45% of the pool. fetch_one treated 5xx as throttling (retry -> THROTTLED -> 30-min cooldown), so after 10 consecutive 500s it cooled down forever and never reached HIT keys. NOT a real rate-limit/ban (verified: aspirin/known-HIT keys still return 200; unknown keys return 500 via both curl and urllib).
  Fix: fetch_one now treats persistent 5xx as a DEFINITIVE non-hit outcome "SERVER5XX" (no retry); only HTTP 429 counts as throttle/cooldown. Daemon caches SERVER5XX + removes from queue (advances). commit interval 50->25. rps 0.3->0.5.
  Verified: queue advancing, throttled=0, HITs resumed (4372 -> 4392+). Cron/watchdog/report unchanged and still installed.
